## Why This Is Asked
Assesses fundamental observability for SAP HANA on AWS, translating SAP metrics into CloudWatch and triggering actionable alerts.

## Key Concepts
- CloudWatch agent for EC2
- CloudWatch dashboards and alarms
- SNS-based alerting
- Minimal IaC (CDK/CFN)

## Code Example
```javascript
// AWS CDK snippet: creates an SNS topic and a CloudWatch alarm for EC2 CPU
const topic = new sns.Topic(this, 'SAPCpuAlarmTopic');
const alarm = new cloudwatch.Alarm(this, 'SAPCpuAlarm', {
  metric: new cloudwatch.Metric({
    namespace: 'AWS/EC2',
    metricName: 'CPUUtilization',
    dimensions: { InstanceId: 'i-0123456789abcdef0' },
  }),
  threshold: 85,
  evaluationPeriods: 1,
  datapointsToAlarm: 1,
  statistic: 'Average',
  treatMissingData: cloudwatch.TreatMissingData.NOT_SET,
});
alarm.addAlarmAction(new actions.SnsAction(topic));
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you extend this to multi-AZ SAP HANA HA?
- How would you incorporate SAP-specific metrics without agent exposure?
- How would you tune alerts to avoid noise?

## Why This Is Asked
This question introduces hands-on observability basics for SAP on AWS, covering log shipping, custom metrics, and alerting.

## Key Concepts
- CloudWatch Logs and CloudWatch Agent for centralized log management
- PutMetricData API for publishing custom metrics like SAP_CPU_GT_85
- CloudWatch Alarms for threshold-based alerting
- SNS for reliable notification delivery
- CloudFormation for Infrastructure as Code (IAM role and alarm creation)

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Resources": {
    "SAPCloudWatchLogsRole": {
      "Type": "AWS::IAM::Role",
      "Properties": {
        "AssumeRolePolicyDocument": {
          "Version": "2012-10-17",
          "Statement": [{
            "Effect": "Allow",
            "Principal": {"Service": "ec2.amazonaws.com"},
            "Action": "sts:AssumeRole"
          }]
        },
        "ManagedPolicyArns": ["arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy"]
      }
    },
    "SAPCPUAlarm": {
      "Type": "AWS::CloudWatch::Alarm",
      "Properties": {
        "AlarmName": "SAP_CPU_GT_85",
        "MetricName": "SAP_CPU_GT_85",
        "Namespace": "SAP/Application",
        "Statistic": "Maximum",
        "Period": 300,
        "EvaluationPeriods": 1,
        "Threshold": 85,
        "ComparisonOperator": "GreaterThanThreshold",
        "AlarmActions": [{"Ref": "SAPSNSTopic"}],
        "TreatMissingData": "notBreaching"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
